-- The vault: the room behind the pipe, and the only level exactly the size of
-- the largest screen — 40x28 — so it never scrolls on any console and the whole
-- room is the view.
--
-- Its exit does not go back to the overworld. Coming back would restart that
-- level, because entering a scene resets it; going on is what makes finding the
-- pipe worth something.

tile #  wall    solid  vaultwall.svg
tile =  ledge   solid  vaultshelf.svg
tile *  exit           gate.svg
tile .  air            dark.svg

map
